    "media_with_text_rBWPLP": {
      "type": "media-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_nfknF9": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "It's built to last",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_PrPm7q": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Made from high-quality cast iron, it can withstand the elements and is ready for any adventure. Its durable construction and versatile uses make it an indispensable companion for all outdoor enthusiasts. </p><p>Of course, it also looks good on a gas grill or any stove. A real all-rounder!</p>",
            "enlarge_text": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
