    "media_with_text_d7DWXR": {
      "type": "media-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_e4AFhN": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The lid has a raised edge",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_GtWrKG": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The raised edge of the lid makes it easy to place coals on the dutch oven as well. This method ensures that the pot is heated evenly from all sides, making it suitable for tasks such as baking bread. The raised edge helps keeps the coals and ash contained to avoid messing on your food every time you open the lid for a sneak peek.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": true
          }
        }
      },
